#: src/languages/astro.md:10
msgid "Using the Tailwind CSS Language Server with Astro"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:12
msgid ""
"To get all the features (autocomplete, linting, etc.) from the [Tailwind CSS "
"language server](https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss-intellisense/"
"tree/HEAD/packages/tailwindcss-language-server#readme) in Astro files, you "
"need to configure the language server so that it knows about where to look "
"for CSS classes by adding the following to your `settings.json`:"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:16
msgid "\"lsp\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:17
msgid "\"tailwindcss-language-server\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:18
msgid "\"settings\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:19
msgid "\"includeLanguages\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:20
msgid "\"astro\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:20
msgid "\"html\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:22
msgid "\"experimental\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:23
msgid "\"classRegex\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:24
msgid "\"class=\\\"([^\\\"]*)\\\"\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:25
msgid "\"class='([^']*)'\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:26
msgid "\"class:list=\\\"{([^}]*)}\\\"\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:27
msgid "\"class:list='{([^}]*)}'\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:36
msgid ""
"With these settings, you will get completions for Tailwind CSS classes in "
"Astro template files. Examples:"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/astro.md:38
msgid ""
"```astro\n"
"---\n"
"const active = true;\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"<!-- Standard class attribute -->\n"
"<div class=\"flex items-center <completion here>\">\n"
"  <p class=\"text-lg font-bold <completion here>\">Hello World</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<!-- class:list directive -->\n"
"<div class:list={[\"flex\", \"items-center\", \"<completion here>\"]}>\n"
"  Content\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<!-- Conditional classes -->\n"
"<div class:list={{ \"flex <completion here>\": active, \"hidden <completion "
"here>\": !active }}>\n"
"  Content\n"
"</div>\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
